    "scenesThatPass": [
      "NATALIE: Fiancee, yeah. Nice to meet you.\nOLIVIA: The heartbreaker from the carshop, right?\nNATALIE: The doctor?\nOLIVIA: The nurse •••",
      "OLIVIA: Hun, please ••.\nNATALIE: It's my fault.~ took the wrong exit at Kinderhook and we ended up heading the wrong direction for like 20 miles ••• You know what they say a…",
      "NATALIE: Why three days?\nOLIVIA: Because after that, the pain subsides. And she'll be off the hook for good.",
      "OLIVIA: And why not?\nMIA: Mom would've hated seeing the cabin like this.\nOLIVIA: No big deal. We'll make it livable, okay Mi?",
      "MIA: That fucking smell! I can't stand it anymore! Let go of me!!!\nOLIVIA: It's OK, it's OK, we're right here .•• Calm down, honey, calm down •.. Breathe baby, breathe."
    ]
